17. Approximate word-matching tables (derived in this app)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/morph/gform.json.gz and data/morph/hform.json.gz list spellings that are
word-tagged in the app's own data (SBLGNT text with STEPBible TAGNT Strong's
numbers, RP2018, and STEPBible TAHOT) with the Strong's keys they are tagged
with. They are derived from items 2, 3 and 12 above, under the same terms
(CC BY 4.0 / public domain). The Septuagint, Targum, Vulgate and TR verses
use them, together with the TBESG/TBESH headwords, to suggest a lexicon
entry for an untagged word. Every such suggestion carries an "approximate
match" label and a confidence level.

